    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, Mantra and the others have already returned to the ship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your guess was correct. Someone is targeting our mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This instrument is from \u00c6gir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broken Little Handy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, can we discover anything from its remaining parts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. The \u00c6gir Academy of Technology put a great deal of care into this delicate piece of equipment\u2014Given their pride, I'll bet they made sure no one could ever crack their Little Handy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the appearance of the Little Handy itself is enough to explain many problems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, do you remember the Joint Marine Corps?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Of course.;The reason you met with the \u00c6gir consul was to facilitate cooperation.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Both the Iberian and Rim Billitonian authorities have responded to our call. The problem is that once cooperation begins, subsequent developments could spiral beyond what we've anticipated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "In recent weeks, the \u00c6gir fleet has not only constructed ports in Iberia, but also established landing sites along the southern coast of Rim Billiton.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "The \u00c6girs from the deep sea made no immediate move to land. Instead, they quickly carried out a number of operations, including hydrographic surveying, under the banner of 'technical cooperation'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "They also quickly assembled a 'Land Patrol' through a mix of hired personnel and official partnerships, relying on more neutral intermediaries to facilitate cooperation with land-based forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "So you're saying the attackers are the 'Land Patrol.'",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're still only speculating\u2014but right now, the Land Patrol is the only one that fits all the evidence we've collected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, some consuls don't back Clementia, yes, but that doesn't prove that \u00c6gir is behind all of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I am more inclined to believe that someone took advantage of the internal conflicts within \u00c6gir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Land Patrol near the Iberian border, the mining ship being handed off in Rim Billiton, the mercenaries on the Kazdelian frontier...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "The breadth of their deployments and the depth of their knowledge about Rhodes Island's classified missions\u2014that's more than enough to prove that \u00c6gir isn't behind this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, there is no possibility of a rebellion within Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I don't believe that will happen either.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, do you think there's anyone else in Rhodes Island who could do that, besides us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......;No.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. No one else could do that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#14$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, the threats that Rhodes Island faces now are unpredictable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Warfarin also warned us several times\u2014the special patients she is caring for\u2014their conditions are deteriorating faster than she can control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether to save our patients or to respond to potential crises, we need more aggressive responses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've reviewed the records Theresa left in the Black Crown\u2014she also made major breakthroughs through her work on Civilight Eterna.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can visit Civilight Eterna to look for potential help, just like Theresa did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We must carefully assess the risks involved, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya, are you sure you're ready?;Are there any other more effective means at the moment, Kal'tsit?",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#8$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I cannot give you a definitive answer, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I will never stop trying. Any advantage I can gain may help Rhodes Island progress further.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this moment when the situation is still unclear, I cannot come up with any more effective measures.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But diving recklessly into Civilight Eterna may not lead to the outcome we hope for, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'll go with Amiya.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, I cannot agree to such a risky plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Can Civilight Eterna link to my thoughts?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, that's too dangerous. No one has ever done something like this before! I agree with Dr. Kal'tsit that you shouldn't take the risk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kal'tsit recalls the experience of her dear friend, which is not something she is happy to recall."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Civilight Eterna can do that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "She did it before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......;Theresa.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, your mind is incredibly complex, but you're not the only one at risk here\u2014Amiya could be exposed to completely unforeseen shocks as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not agree to this preposterous proposal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, this is my opinion. I cannot interfere with yours and the Doctor's final decision on this matter, but I hope you understand my stance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#5$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya, I can open my mind to you completely.;We don't have to force it in one. We can give it a few tries.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Dr. Kal'tsit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "When it's all over, we'll go apologize to her together.;It's not this plan she's opposed to, per se.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I trust you, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'll leave the decision of when to stop entirely up to you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Let's start after I finish arranging the defenses.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_rhodescom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$storyendjp_intro",
        "key": "$storyendjp_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "npc_10002",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$Mon3tr_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "npc_10002",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Muffled roar)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you worried about me? I'm not mad at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once again, we've arrived at a critical turning point. And last time\u2026 Babel met the fate I dreaded most.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "It turns out that I can't make sure everything is running on its ideal track, Mon3tr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "npc_10002",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Raises claw)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Rubs gently)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our own limitations have begun to affect our usefulness in more important endeavors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "We may be able to witness the changes of the stars and the untamed cosmos, but when faced with a real crisis, we're no different from any other creatures on this great land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "npc_10002",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Dissatisifed growl)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for comforting me. I can sense your good intentions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "npc_10002",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Anxious growl)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I suppose Amiya and the Doctor have already begun preparing to delve deeper into Civilight Eterna.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not interfere with Amiya's decision. She is mature enough to make the most correct judgment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Doctor... the Doctor isn't quite the same anymore either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I still have a glimmer of hope in my heart. Maybe, this time the outcome will be different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
