    },
    {
        "text": "(Subdued bow)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is true that my own sanity is constantly warning me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Touching the Doctor's mind again with the help of Civilight Eterna is not a sound decision, but Amiya is right, we don't have much choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
