    {
        "text": "(Affectionate murmur)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're wrong. I do not feel hopeless, Mon3tr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am delighted that the Ancients overthrew the rule of the Elders, and I am also pleased that Lugalszargus set the starting point for a new civilization.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have made mistakes out of arrogance, but I have also regained my confidence by making dear friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe yours and my basic structures will always be alien to this land, but that doesn't mean we will always walk alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've found my home, in Rhodes Island, on this great land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've fulfilled her expectations, Mon3tr. I've learned to love. I've found myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Moves confusedly)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Wraps tail around Kal'tsit)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must protect Amiya and the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must protect the true variable here... the future I cannot even glimpse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've communicated with Civilight Eterna before, yet I haven't been able to break through my own limitations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Amiya can. Of that, Theresa and I are certain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure she can pluck significance from the massive trove of data. With Theresa's blessing\u2026 she can do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is still Amiya, after all. I have seen her grow into a leader with my own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Following in footsteps, she might find some words that one left behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the past, when Originium had not yet taken shape, there was an era when luminaries competed to argue with the epoch itself. Their wonderful ideas, born of a desire to celebrate and save lives, still persist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "All is not yet lost, Mon3tr. Terra has a chance, no matter how faint, to keep that hope alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$Mon3tr_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Excited howl)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me? No, Mon3tr, I'm better at memories... remembering the history I witnessed, and have seen erased by time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am not special at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kal'tsit calmly inscribes the important info into Mon3tr's spine."
    },
    {
        "text": "If the outcome I fear most does come to pass, if the one I least want to see stands in front of us once more\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Protect the Doctor. Protect Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will engrave this directive into your basic behavioral strategy matrix.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Agitated howling)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, Mon3tr. We still have work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the threat does come, I must ensure that Rhodes Island is Terra's first outpost against the crisis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I will be your final safeguard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
